menu "ESP Bytebeat Configuration"

    config ESP_BYTEBEAT_USE_DSP
        bool "Use the ESP-DSP square-root function"
        default y
        help
            Use dsps_sqrtf_f32 for square-root operations. Trigonometric and
            other math functions continue to use the standard C math library.
            The selected ESP-DSP implementation and its performance depend on
            the target and build configuration; no speedup is guaranteed.

            If disabled, sqrtf from the standard C math library is used.

endmenu
